WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:09,650
What's going on

2
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:11,740
It's probably just the wind

3
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,700
Is it the wind or a ghost blowing the lamp?

4
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:19,890
Damn, did you see that?

5
00:00:20,090 --> 00:00:21,050
Why don't you stop?

6
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:22,290
Must persist until dawn

7
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:27,330
These black silk threads

8
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,650
They all come out of the darkness

9
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:35,490
It's daybreak. Do you want to move on?

10
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:37,410
No, keep driving for another forty minutes.

11
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:53,220
There are still hundreds of ghosts chasing behind the team. It’s okay. I survived.

12
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:54,460
We survived

13
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:55,740
General Mo's leadership till now

14
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:59,920
It's the first time I've seen so many ghost clothes. You just said

15
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,920
There are hundreds of ghost clothes behind the team

16
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:04,850
Maybe not worth it yet
